{"reviews":[{"id":"B077YR59ZR-0","r":3.0,"t":"Only problem is that it doesn\u2019t look like the product picture","x":"Very cute stickers. Only problem is that it doesn\u2019t look like the product picture. Instead of black and white, it\u2019s a faded black, almost grayish tone to it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-1","r":2.0,"t":"The adhesive on these stickers is terrible. It's so weak that I have to keep ...","x":"The adhesive on these stickers is terrible. It's so weak that I have to keep jamming the stickers onto my bath bombs every single day (in order to keep the wrapping around them).  I also had to throw away a couple of them since they had been covered/ruined by the sales tag holding the roll together. Will not be buying these again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-2","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and affordable!","x":"Love these stickers for my handmade soy candles! I use these to seal the box and they look adorable. I love how affordable these are too.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-3","r":4.0,"t":"Cute","x":"Like others before me the sticker label they used to keep the roll from unraveling basically damaged two of the stickers.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great add on !!","x":"Adorable it just made my product more personal !!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-5","r":4.0,"t":"I'm pleased","x":"[[VIDEOID:73ecde9311607211063b1187db5a653d]] The only fault with this is the fact that they places a sticker on the stickers themselves so that might be some wasted there. I gave 4 for adhesive cause I haven't tried it yet but will def update when I do.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great for that something extra","x":"We love these stickers. We run a business from home whit handmade items and put these on the packages. They are a great way to add something extra for the customer. Which we have actually gotten positive comments for putting these on the packages.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-7","r":5.0,"t":"So adorable!","x":"Use these for all my handmade soaps & bath fizz. They\u2019re the perfect size to fit on the tops of the jars I bought and add that little extra touch to everything!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-8","r":4.0,"t":"Good stickers","x":"I use these to seal the goody bags.They adhere well. It's matte stickers with less saturated black, not like glossy commercial labels. But still good enough!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-9","r":5.0,"t":"Sticks to tissue/kraft paper and holds!","x":"Been using these for packing orders and they grip on nicely to tissue and Kraft paper. They're the size of a half dollar and adds a nice touch to packaging!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-10","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent value for the money","x":"I picked up these stickers for a bake sale. They adhered well to both plastic bags and bakery boxes. I am very happy with them and would order them again!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-11","r":5.0,"t":"Cute, and a great price!","x":"It would be nice if they could find another way to package it so that a couple of stickers didn't get ruined but other than that a great product!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-12","r":5.0,"t":"Love these stickers!","x":"Love these stickers!! Use them for my crafts! First few get torn off pealing the sticker off that hols it together. But there\u2019s plenty left!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-13","r":3.0,"t":"Dark gray not black","x":"The color is really dark gray rather than black, looks washed out. But It\u2019s a big roll, if you like that kind of look, it\u2019s great value!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-14","r":5.0,"t":"VERY nice looking. I will order again","x":"Great product. Very nice looking. I used them for all kinds of items that I sell at craft fairs. Classy looking.  I will buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great!!","x":"I love how they stick to different types of bakery boxes! So cute and just add that little extra touch! Thank you, will buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great value","x":"I use these for my small business and I love them. They look cute and the quality is top! For the price you can\u2019t beat it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-17","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"Quality stickers with good adhesion. They add the perfect touch to my handmade crafts ! What a great idea!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-18","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and so many for the money","x":"I use these for my bags that I put my resin keychains in I\u2019m going to use them on my homemade soap wraps.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-19","r":4.0,"t":"You get what you pay for","x":"Not what I was expecting. I thought the labels would be a bit larger. But you get what you pay for.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-20","r":5.0,"t":"Cute. Simple. Just what I needed!!","x":"I loved these. Used them for homemade treats at a bake sell and on my smaller candles I made. \u2764\ufe0f","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-21","r":5.0,"t":"Draws attention to your baked goods","x":"Purchased these stickers for a bake sale - wanted to jazz up the packaging.  It did the trick.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-22","r":5.0,"t":"perfect for all my crafts!","x":"it really makes the craft that much better. looks very professional with the stickers on them","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-23","r":4.0,"t":"Quality sticker","x":"The stickers were exactly as described - plus, super cute.  Made our baked items stand out!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B077YR59ZR-24","r":5.0,"t":"They work great for what I do","x":"They work great on any surface for the baking and sewing I use them to add to the package","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the stickers cute and a nice touch for handmade items and packaging.","cites":[3,5,7,8,10,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the stickers adhere well to various surfaces like tissue, kraft paper, plastic bags, and boxes.","cites":[9,10,11]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers report that the sticker holding the roll together damages or ruins a few stickers.","cites":[2,4,6,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the color is dark gray or faded rather than true black.","cites":[1,9,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the stickers as affordable and good value.","cites":[3,11,12,14]}]},"qa":[]}